    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33268" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ozaena</span></b> , ae, f., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄζαινα</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A kind of polypus</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ozaena, dicta a gravi capitis odore,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 30, 48, § 89</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A polypus in the nose</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">narium ozaenae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					25, 13, 104, § 165</span></i>
			.</div>
